# Keep line endings consistent regardless of which OS clones/commits -
# this repo mixes Windows batch/PowerShell (CRLF-native) with TypeScript
# and Markdown (LF-native); without this, a Windows git checkout can
# silently flip LF files to CRLF and make every line of a future diff
# look changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
